770987554","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104761#issuecomment-2770987554","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104761","id":2770987554,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lKeoi","user":{"login":"austin226","id":1923662,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjM2NjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1923662?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/austin226","html_url":"https://github.com/austin226","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/austin226/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/austin226/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/austin226/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/austin226/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/austin226/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/austin226/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/austin226/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/austin226/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/austin226/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-02T00:44:29Z","updated_at":"2025-04-02T00:44:29Z","body":"I was able to add this script to my scene as a workaround:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nvar _last_size: Vector2i\nvar _exposure_off_frames: int = 0\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tget_viewport().size_changed.connect(_on_size_changed)\n\nfunc _on_size_changed() -> void:\n\t_exposure_off_frames = 2\n\t_last_size = get_viewport().size\n\tget_viewport().get_camera_3d().attributes.auto_exposure_enabled = false\n\tprint(\"Auto exposure off\")\n\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n\tif _exposure_off_frames > 0:\n\t\t_exposure_off_frames -= 1\n\t\tif _exposure_off_frames == 0:\n\t\t\tif get_viewport().size == _last_size:\n\t\t\t\tget_viewport().get_camera_3d().attributes.auto_exposure_enabled = true\n\t\t\t\tprint(\"Auto exposure on\")\n\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2770987554/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]